6. PROHIBITED AUTOMATED GAMEPLAY. This Software may not be used, deployed,
   or integrated - in original or modified form - to:
   a) play in any official, ranked, unranked, casual, or competitive online
      match on any game platform, or participate in any tournament, event, or competition
      involving human players, whether official or unofficial, except where
      explicitly permitted under Clause 8;
   b) obtain, preserve, or manipulate competitive rank, MMR, season rewards,
      titles, or any progression metric on any account;
   c) substitute for a human player in any matchmade or player-versus-player
      environment, regardless of intent or awareness of other participants;
   d) automate gameplay actions (movement, boost, shooting, saving, etc.)
      in any live online session where the opposing or allied players are
      human or believe they are playing against/with humans;
   e) operate as a cheat, aimbot, macro, script, or any prohibited automation
      tool under any game platform's Terms of Service or acceptable use policy;
   f) circumvent bans, restrictions, or account penalties on any platform;
   g) run on accounts not solely owned and operated by the licensee for
      sanctioned offline or bot-only use;
   h) assist, augment, or supplement a human player's gameplay in any online
      session by automating, suggesting, or executing any game action - including
      but not limited to movement, positioning, boost usage - regardless of whether the
      human player retains final input control;
   i) deploy this Software in any context prohibited under Clause 6 for the stated or
      unstated purpose of testing, development, research, or debugging. Testing and
      development must be conducted exclusively in offline or sanctioned environments as
      described in Clause 8. The act of testing or researching does not override or
      suspend any prohibition in this license.
   j) deploy any model, agent, or bot derived from or trained using this
      Software - in whole or in part - in any context prohibited by this
      clause, regardless of how many training steps, architectural changes,
      or modifications separate the derivative from this Software.

7. Modified versions distributed to others must prominently include a clear,
   human-readable notice of modification, including a reasonable summary of
   modifications and the date of modification.

8. PERMITTED AUTOMATED PLAY. Notwithstanding Clause 6, the following uses
   are explicitly permitted:
   a) Hosting this Software as a bot participant in isolated sessions
      where all human participants are explicitly aware they are playing
      alongside or against one or more bots, provided:
      - no human player is deceived into believing they are playing against
        another human;
      - the session is not connected to any official ranked or matchmaking
        system;
      - the hosting is free and non-commercial per Clause 5.
   b) Offline play against the bot with no online account involvement.
   c) Sanctioned RLBot tournaments or exhibitions where all participants
      are aware they are playing against a bot.

9. TRAINING AND MODEL RESTRICTIONS. This Software, including any neural
   network weights, model checkpoints, behavioral data, or inference logic
   distributed with it, may not be used as:
   a) a base for further reinforcement learning, behavioral cloning,
      imitation learning, transfer learning, fine-tuning, or any other
      training process with the intent or result of producing a model
      deployed in any context prohibited under Clause 6;
   b) a data source or demonstration provider for training any other model
      or agent intended for deployment in any context prohibited under
      Clause 6.
   Training for personal research, development, or contribution back to the
   RLBot community is permitted, provided the resulting model is not deployed
   in any prohibited context under Clause 6. The burden of ensuring compliant
   deployment lies solely with the licensee.

